diff --git a/changelog.d/1230.change.md b/changelog.d/1230.change.md
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..a0e7be6
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/1230.change.md
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+`AttributeError`s raised by properties (and other descriptors) are not swallowed anymore by the `__getattr__` that slotted classes with `functools.cached_property`s get.
+Previously, such errors were replaced by an `AttributeError` claiming the attribute doesn't exist -- for example when a `cached_property` accessed a `property` that raises.
